WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.670
One-hot encoding creates separate indicator columns
With Bronze as

00:00:05.696 --> 00:00:12.041
the reference category the generated columns
represent Silver Gold and Platinum Bronze

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:17.855
is represented by all zeros This is useful when we
do not want a model

00:00:17.882 --> 00:00:24.391
to treat categories as points on one numeric line
The tradeoff is dimensionality

00:00:25.327 --> 00:00:28.656
Variables with many categories can create many
columns
